{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/581n47g1fenr82mpz4sezxvhuvdj4pr.mp3","text":"做博士的护卫？好哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:4/44/2t0tqxrvvwthebxwy3g3sybp8ezacns.mp3","text":"爸爸不知道现在过得好不好......不过，感觉市长是一个说话算话的人，应该没问题吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/83/6fgmjz78uqnlvbddvwei9ibh1dettm3.mp3","text":"多索雷斯虽然很吵闹，也有许多坏人，但是在那里的生活还是比在外面的玻利瓦尔要好许多呢......博士没有去过吗？那下次一起去吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5e/rp521forcyq6yyoe7rix439x2c8do4k.mp3","text":"呼......一整天都待在房间里感觉好闷。博士，我们一起去甲板上呼吸新鲜空气吧？博士工作了这么久也累了吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3f/piaa2esphkh93bsw8u5poezdf6qrak1.mp3","text":"博士喜欢打打杀杀的事情吗？我其实也没有很喜欢呢，只是一直以来都在做类似的事情，身边的人也都在做类似的事情，不知不觉地就习惯了......","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f9/552r55lp8f1t69byg5ddwpxx990wi4d.mp3","text":"变强虽然是好事，但是变强之后好像也没有要做的事......博士是怎么决定自己想要做什么事的呢？","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:f/ff/8lgtxlelrxbqzvaehopmt6qzyagwofo.mp3","text":"一直以来，爸爸其实都不希望我帮他做事，因为博士你也知道我的性格，其实是不太适合做这种事的。但是我毕竟成为了爸爸的女儿，所以也努力了哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/89/2sn117flqxfqe8cixo0v7ngz2f3f4e2.mp3","text":"博士博士，我可以坐在离博士近一点的地方吗？唔，因为办公室这么大，离博士远了感觉会有些冷清，不行吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/96wg690lby26kanca7v4bov856bkkew.mp3","text":"博士明明一点都不能打，但是却和爸爸一样可靠呢，感觉我什么都不用去想，只要听博士的话就好了。嗯？对我来说，这样就好哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9c/tuptc49nzttuvel45k48p4qy1vseoww.mp3","text":"博士面罩下面是什么样的呢，悄悄看看吧......","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a1/j7u0zhxs6vlwjle2z6yuek7jw05rkm5.mp3","text":"博士，你好，我是陈小姐推荐来的，名字是拉菲艾拉，今天开始正式加入罗德岛。欸，代号？唔......就叫我羽毛笔吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5d/67hm6jcink68wxrw0w0i0src79kjvla.mp3","text":"唔......这个我真的能做到吗。","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9d/3g0uz3blt8kc2p2mvj3ogletzh0it4d.mp3","text":"博士，找我有什么事吗？咦，升职？唔......我做了什么很厉害的事吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a8/5o1sign40aw1vrluadld84ljwhflgva.mp3","text":"博士，我现在变得比以前更厉害了吗？真的吗？我自己没有什么感觉呢......不过既然博士这么说，那一定是这样吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bf/qxkglxor65qku49q3he0y0dwafibtqe.mp3","text":"欸，要出任务了吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7a/p2levdgibzhy43fwjql0cotr4oye975.mp3","text":"我挺擅长带路哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c2/m6urh8as7hm61dfifwedlqjmf1omx51.mp3","text":"这一次要去哪里来着？","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3c/7dbbw22p09j3edged8jdengpue4rlqw.mp3","text":"接下来可不能走神了呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a1/nzxej6rwo08jp7ryitqe91wor6s3uqx.mp3","text":"哇，博士，不要吓我。","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6a/ax0fi19d6sci38vgtqug96k6bsswvo6.mp3","text":"我听博士的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/6hvreyfyihoq55le21shz5mp9apc6nx.mp3","text":"好哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/499z8ml6r6j8i7q6jboo4ghtoo46xtc.mp3","text":"不让他们过去就可以了吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:3/36/ruo14p5rtlmu4e2z1zjkeh71xjn82q6.mp3","text":"喝！","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8d/5qel3xryzei6bt9760eca8vhbmhzrdz.mp3","text":"把你砍成两半！","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1f/bsg3l3f4yvt5e2u6xszts8cg5ah9uyl.mp3","text":"比想象的要费劲一点呢......","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/98/jpjznre1f8ng7ty1dvfzibwcb4enzp8.mp3","text":"快点结束掉吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:0/00/copziuqdinfnko6xikthnqmxd5sqbev.mp3","text":"我都不知道，原来我连这样的任务都能完成欸......","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8c/a3xoui4s1a5h8fijh1ikvvm5wb4d1xf.mp3","text":"博士，好厉害！","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0a/m9ldkbe4pvaw7yxvmmvsqhy1qepsq60.mp3","text":"博士，交给我吧，我去追。","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:8/88/3sr4zo7b8it0i6r97mej0kzfhhzt4a2.mp3","text":"博士，这边这边，该跑路了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:8/87/0iryeck77vlbk17lrz4f676hmn0tc4l.mp3","text":"罗德岛的走廊好宽哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5d/34zbxzc82ti8jg1cl1rpf78wsqtldkq.mp3","text":"唔嗯？","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0c/9vwroo9gml2ice8zilikeuof78dbqog.mp3","text":"去看看博士在做什么吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:1/17/pjq9706bfh6j5jjfatl6oua2grartpt.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:1/12/kx51fd6ckzutpj11ihwu73yrv2375xn.mp3","text":"博士，新年快乐。罗德岛的新年好热闹呀，你看那边，干员们组织了好多项目哦，看上去好有意思。博士，我去玩哪个比较好呢？帮我做个决定吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f4/56ef057hflmk1pgowhuks0sjgrf6oz6.mp3","text":"......咦，博士，你什么时候到我面前的？","alt":"voice_cn/char_421_crow/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:c/ca/5w523vtdhodp86utwyrg6w91jpaw2ui.mp3","text":"做博士的护卫？好哦。","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ed/mx64c1sa7qi2cnoldsl1r1xt66vwxaw.mp3","text":"爸爸不知道现在过得好不好......不过，感觉市长是一个说话算话的人，应该没问题吧。","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/60/pax8f7tomo3kd9t2n2rzh3xpuliuvze.mp3","text":"多索雷斯虽然很吵闹，也有许多坏人，但是在那里的生活还是比在外面的玻利瓦尔要好许多呢......博士没有去过吗？那下次一起去吧。","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5f/j5t5rvcrh0cp3kc7z799oogwyqf9w3l.mp3","text":"呼......一整天都待在房间里感觉好闷。博士，我们一起去甲板上呼吸新鲜空气吧？博士工作了这么久也累了吧。","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:1/11/86brbsby4ijmq1kzvgzmhc5z72k5s7j.mp3","text":"博士喜欢打打杀杀的事情吗？我其实也没有很喜欢呢，只是一直以来都在做类似的事情，身边的人也都在做类似的事情，不知不觉地就习惯了......","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/69/83buv1zhnd4slsriaw97edngw221gu6.mp3","text":"变强虽然是好事，但是变强之后好像也没有要做的事......博士是怎么决定自己想要做什么事的呢？","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c9/lphtpezpluih9zlkx38qkwxdt63bdwy.mp3","text":"一直以来，爸爸其实都不希望我帮他做事，因为博士你也知道我的性格，其实是不太适合做这种事的。但是我毕竟成为了爸爸的女儿，所以也努力了哦。","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/73/2m7mdnbudp1twiiazbsavgoyp9tv77p.mp3","text":"博士博士，我可以坐在离博士近一点的地方吗？唔，因为办公室这么大，离博士远了感觉会有些冷清，不行吗？","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/08/5n0mdmvym3ztt0exeaqppo9muatxw4j.mp3","text":"博士明明一点都不能打，但是却和爸爸一样可靠呢，感觉我什么都不用去想，只要听博士的话就好了。嗯？对我来说，这样就好哦。","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9f/3qwf1zqwa05xvspa8q5f64rbxpcfhf6.mp3","text":"博士面罩下面是什么样的呢，悄悄看看吧......","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a0/5ofic9gcuwdce270j04m134a8mp4eny.mp3","text":"博士，你好，我是陈小姐推荐来的，名字是拉菲艾拉，今天开始正式加入罗德岛。欸，代号？唔......就叫我羽毛笔吧。","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ae/03txkq4ewsosbwlb7e57qsjxyinb8ck.mp3","text":"唔......这个我真的能做到吗。","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:8/81/8hr6xfyva3dktevof5879ipx310nrvq.mp3","text":"博士，找我有什么事吗？咦，升职？唔......我做了什么很厉害的事吗？","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ae/324k9ss4hbzel1le0powao9at7tm7xy.mp3","text":"博士，我现在变得比以前更厉害了吗？真的吗？我自己没有什么感觉呢......不过既然博士这么说，那一定是这样吧。","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ec/p7iqs21ztflp5se9awxzrgp38ea20ue.mp3","text":"欸，要出任务了吗？","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fd/3asd8jxwq3505bsklbj31jwwf7odp6q.mp3","text":"我挺擅长带路哦。","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fa/hwy82h7kru2l08eap87c06nbjggq8gw.mp3","text":"这一次要去哪里来着？","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/qtvt5fs0cuq79nixatioib4r9o64ssd.mp3","text":"接下来可不能走神了呢。","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:6/67/42fysgnd9cjoqigwjb1e7p97eqmd98c.mp3","text":"哇，博士，不要吓我。","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/cf/qjifzjsamfxo2vx90yazclfoceahww5.mp3","text":"我听博士的。","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c9/8hvjjml4iko5yybuig9srxr9h9q5mpp.mp3","text":"好哦。","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b2/1s3vodqpn2vfte7ycdw4yloxoaw26pq.mp3","text":"不让他们过去就可以了吗？","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:2/22/ecfm3s20t5f9hwcaqhezqrk1tmx2lrj.mp3","text":"喝！","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/ca/ox7l11lryzg4fetrjunldv0blvy0ybv.mp3","text":"把你砍成两半！","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b9/b16oa6dfk8qb2vh4i2ixsqw9nghofm4.mp3","text":"比想象的要费劲一点呢......","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/42/h0hkjep7guo1dqun6ncl6mnd3hj4hg2.mp3","text":"快点结束掉吧。","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c7/ttx24foi2cchb3dyrn26szd3r1m2ent.mp3","text":"我都不知道，原来我连这样的任务都能完成欸......","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0b/qqqde5c8v0cp9bab9zmj2z5weecsk46.mp3","text":"博士，好厉害！","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:4/44/3bklogow10l0ibbdw3edc2clbvy965j.mp3","text":"博士，交给我吧，我去追。","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4a/nqsbkairixtji1b2banviy5ajaog86n.mp3","text":"博士，这边这边，该跑路了。","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a1/fdwzgd3dsutrshgms0td6wkqvfaztmk.mp3","text":"罗德岛的走廊好宽哦。","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3c/q43ngsrpwubocydukpa61djhfdggkhm.mp3","text":"唔嗯？","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9b/1r62cipnhmf3ypkafkl6ba9j88sycn0.mp3","text":"去看看博士在做什么吧。","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1e/6ijyfq8dlb16xjyteasgq8laj796s39.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:c/ce/5syd203viiof6nbu27y29d5aaeqmv8j.mp3","text":"博士，新年快乐。罗德岛的新年好热闹呀，你看那边，干员们组织了好多项目哦，看上去好有意思。博士，我去玩哪个比较好呢？帮我做个决定吧。","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:4/41/b88oxxsissf04qf1u3mz24txuf9tt7m.mp3","text":"......咦，博士，你什么时候到我面前的？","alt":"voice/char_421_crow/cn_042.mp3